WEBVTT

00:18:59.583 --> 00:19:01.143
The point is exactly that,

00:19:01.167 --> 00:19:04.309
while you're not there,
I know you're doing your job.

00:19:04.333 --> 00:19:07.809
While I am gone, I know you're not
rolling me under the bus.

00:19:07.833 --> 00:19:10.476
You have my back, we are in this together.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.559
We share meanings, expectations,

00:19:12.583 --> 00:19:15.059
and we predict that we
are there for each other.

00:19:15.083 --> 00:19:17.018
That's the foundational truth of trust,

00:19:17.042 --> 00:19:20.059
and I don't see that coming up
because I know your agenda.

00:19:20.083 --> 00:19:22.143
AG: There's also
a power component in this.

00:19:22.167 --> 00:19:23.518
EP: Do you agree with that?

00:19:23.542 --> 00:19:26.059
AG: You're now trying to get us
into agree, disagree?

00:19:26.083 --> 00:19:29.143
I'm trying to complicate things
and learn here, Esther, come on.

00:19:29.167 --> 00:19:32.768
EP: No, but I mean,
do you think that transparency,